                                        <span class="timeline-date"
                                            >February 2025 - March 2025</span
                                        >
                                        <h3 class="timeline-title">
                                            Food Prediction Project
                                        </h3>
                                        <p class="timeline-org">
                                            CSC311 (Introduction to Machine
