                                            prediction accuracy
                                        </p>
                                        <div class="skills">
                                            <span class="skill-tag"
                                                >Machine Learning</span
                                            >
                                            <span class="skill-tag">CNNs</span>
                                            <span class="skill-tag"
                                                >Statistics</span
                                            >
